      "writtenOn": "2015-11-07T21:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m ok with accepting unknown things but not things we straight up don\u0027t want to support. Domains/pins in base-configs don\u0027t make sense and we shouldn\u0027t support them.\n\nwrt nesting a domain-config in a base config this is already the behavior (inheritance wise) of domain-config entries, and I dont want two ways to have the same inheritance behavior.",
